title: IainSchweblinLibrary
---
OMG I'm in a freaking libray WTF MAN this is messed up
Iain Schweblin: Walking into the library, a wave of familiarity washes over him. He sits down on the velvet couch and sighs. 
->Do nothing.
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	 Iain goes over to one of the shelves and picks up one of the books. It’s a collection of stories by Edgar Allan Poe. He reclines on the velvet couch to read. 
->Have one of the books fall off the shelf. 
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	It hits the ground with a loud smack. Iain picks up the book. It’s a collection of stories by Edgar Allan Poe. He reclines on the velvet couch to read. 
->Drop the floor out from under him.
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    <<discover_fear "Iain Schweblin" 6>>
    <<terrified "Iain Schweblin">>
    //Fear of Heights
	He looks down to see his feet dangling above a huge chasm. Slamming his eyes closed, he convinces himself it’s just a trick of the mind. He clutches his knees to his chest and rocks back and forth. He opens them again and sees that the room is just as it was before the hallucination. 
->Have the bookshelf fall over.
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	Startled, Iain leaps up from the couch and runs to the bookcase. He lifts it upright and begins organizing the books. This process calms him, reminding him of home. 
