title: IainSchweblinDungeon
---
Iain Schweblin: The dungeon’s torch lights hypnotizes Iain. It’s the first natural thing he’s seen in the place. The warm light comforts him, and he’s transfixed by its flickering movement.
->Snuff out the flames.
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    <<discover_fear "Iain Schweblin" 7>>
    <<terrified "Iain Schweblin">>
    //Fear of Darkness
	The flame disappears, and the room goes dark. Smoke floats up from the torch. Iain whips his head around, trying to figure out what happened. He begins to hyperventilate as his eyes try to adjust to the darkness. 
->Fan the flames.
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	The flames grow in size. Iain smiles in wonder as it pushes up toward the ceiling. He backs away, afraid the room will catch fire. Eventually, the flame returns to its original size.
->Do nothing.
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	He eventually moves on from the flames and explores the individual cells.
->Change the color of the flame to blue.
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	Startled, he jumps back. His eyes stay locked on the flame. “What is causing that?”
