title: IainSchweblinDiningRoom
---
Iain Schweblin: Iain stands at the head of the dining room table, surveying the room.
->”Inspect the dusty plates on the table.”
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	He looks at the plates. “Boring.”
->”Inspect the plants.”
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    <<discover_fear "Iain Schweblin" 8>>
    <<terrified "Iain Schweblin">>
    //Fear of Beetles
	He looks down at the potted plants. “It looks like it’s dying.” As he walks away, he feels something on his shoulder. Glancing right, he sees a beetle crawling toward his face. He screams and swats it off. He can’t escape the feeling that beetles have infested his skin. 
->”This room is boring. You want to leave.”
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	“Yeah, I should get out of here.” He paces around for a moment before leaving. 
->”Inspect the cobwebs in the corner of the room.”
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	He walks over to the corner of the room and watches tiny spiders crawl along their webs. “Cool.”
