title: IainSchweblinEncounterMackenzieJoyce
---
Iain Schweblin: Iain looks ahead of him to see a young woman coming towards him from beyond the shadow.
->”Introduce yourself.”
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	“My name is Iain.” He stretches out his hand to shake hers. Before she can grab it, you use your powers to erase their memories and move them past each other.
->”It’s the ghost of your wife.”
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    <<discover_fear "Iain Schweblin" 2>>
    <<terrified "Iain Schweblin">>
    //Trauma from wife's death
	“It’s her when we first met.” He knows this is the labyrinth playing tricks on him, but he can’t move past it. He is frozen in place. She walks up to him. Before they can talk, you use your powers to move them past each other.
->”It’s a monster.”
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	“Doesn’t look like a monster.” He stretches out his hand to shake hers. Before she can grab it, you use your powers to erase their memories and move them past each other.
->”It’s your stalker.”
    <<neutral "Iain Schweblin">>
	The thought doesn’t bother Iain. He thinks its good that someone knows he’s here. He stretches out his hand to shake hers. Before she can grab it, you use your powers to erase their memories and move them past each other.
